    <Section Name="ManageMenu_Item">
      <Phrase Key="Item_Viewer_Title">Manage this Item</Phrase>
      <Phrase Key="Item_Intro_Prompt">How would you like to manage this item today?</Phrase>
      <Phrase Key="Group_Level_Note">In addition, the following changes can be made at the item group level:</Phrase>
      <Phrase Key="Group_Viewer_Title">Manage this Item Group</Phrase>
      <Phrase Key="Group_Intro_Prompt">How would you like to manage this item group today?</Phrase>
      <Phrase Key="Open_Textbook_Desc">Manage this open textbook item, allowing you to edit the page content, add images, add new chapters, etc..</Phrase>
      <Phrase Key="Edit_Metadata_Link">Edit Item Metadata</Phrase>
      <Phrase Key="Edit_Metadata_Desc">Edit the information about this item which appears in the citation/description.  This is basic information about the original item and this digital manifestation.</Phrase>
      <Phrase Key="Edit_Tei_Link">Edit TEI</Phrase>
      <Phrase Key="Edit_Tei_Desc">Edit this TEI object, including the XSLT and CSS file used as well as uploading a new TEI file or editing the existing TEI file online.</Phrase>
      <Phrase Key="Edit_Behaviors_Link">Edit Item Behaviors</Phrase>
      <Phrase Key="Edit_Behaviors_Desc">Change the way this item behaves in this library, including which aggregations it appears under, the wordmarks to the left, and which viewer types are publicly accessible.</Phrase>
      <Phrase Key="Qc_Link">Manage Pages and Divisions (Quality Control)</Phrase>
      <Phrase Key="Qc_Desc">Reorder page images, name pages, assign divisions, and delete and add new page images to this item.</Phrase>
      <Phrase Key="Work_History_Link">View Work History</Phrase>
      <Phrase Key="Work_History_Desc">View the history of all work performed on this item.  From this view, you can also see any digitization milestones and digital resource file information.</Phrase>
      <Phrase Key="Download_Files_Link">Manage Download Files</Phrase>
      <Phrase Key="Download_Files_Desc">Upload new files for download or remove existing files that are attached to this item for download.  This generally includes everything except for the page images.</Phrase>
      <Phrase Key="Geospatial_Link">Manage Geo-Spatial Data (beta)</Phrase>
      <Phrase Key="Geospatial_Desc">Add geo-spatial information for this item.  This can be as simple as a location for a photograph or can be an overlay for a map.  Points, lines, and polygons of interest can also be drawn.</Phrase>
      <Phrase Key="Tracking_Sheet_Link">View Tracking Sheet</Phrase>
      <Phrase Key="Tracking_Sheet_Desc">This can be used for printing the tracking sheet for this item, which can be used as part of the built-in digitization workflow.</Phrase>
      <Phrase Key="Group_Behaviors_Link">Edit Item Group Behaviors</Phrase>
      <Phrase Key="Group_Behaviors_Desc">Set the title under which all of these items appear in search results and set the web skins under which all these items should appear.</Phrase>
      <Phrase Key="Add_Volume_Link">Add New Volume</Phrase>
      <Phrase Key="Add_Volume_Desc">Add a new, related volume to this item group.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</Phrase>
      <Phrase Key="Mass_Update_Link">Mass Update Item Behaviors</Phrase>
      <Phrase Key="Mass_Update_Desc">This allows item-level behaviors to be set for all items within this item group, including which aggregations it appears under, the wordmarks to the left, and which viewer types are publicly accessible.</Phrase>
    </Section>

  </Localization>
</SobekCM_Config>
